EO:11987,FRDOC:95-28153,95-28153,Proposed Rule,1995-11-27,60 FR 58468,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,2,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/1995/11/27/95-28153.txt,997da573684f93aac21b4627db1adf3830c0f0fe08a04b7b4df1fa98fa3573c2,"One of the legal authorities under which the Service is authorized is Executive Order 11987, entitled, ``Exotic Organisms.'' This Executive Order directs Federal agencies to restrict the introduction of exotic species into natural ecosystems of the Untied States."
