EO:13132,FRDOC:03-20023,03-20023,Proposed Rule,2003-08-07,68 FR 46984,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,1,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2003/08/07/03-20023.txt,a651c48279ef715264bf78e22c990b752e0de0ce431d5a496a1a8daed32a5962,"A rule has implications for federalism under Executive Order 13132, Federalism, if it has a substantial direct effect on State or local governments and would either preempt State law or impose a substantial direct cost of compliance on them."
