EO:13197,FRDOC:E6-7784,E6-7784,Proposed Rule,2006-05-23,71 FR 29593,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,2,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2006/05/23/E6-7784.txt,925d0b375c28d18914f1d741772c9f8685b493e56f8270066bac62b62c931b29,"This regulation implements provisions of the Act, as well as Executive Order 13197, Governmentwide Accountability for Merit System Principles; Workforce Information (January 18, 2001)."
EO:13203,FRDOC:E6-8697,E6-8697,Proposed Rule,2006-06-06,71 FR 32494,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,1,True,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2006/06/06/E6-8697.txt,5a754cbb154dc1607ad8e27ed5db71e6f411e9f336a335c328958fc885f4275c,"No action was ever taken on the recommendation when the ``partnership'' was dissolved by Executive Order 13203 on February 17, 2001."
