EO:13360,FRDOC:E9-28461,E9-28461,Rule,2009-12-08,74 FR 64619,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,2,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2009/12/08/E9-28461.txt,4456145f76a9a644158e5ec4eda6c90efdab077bc66e977c23635f6247c8f559,"SUMMARY: This document implements portions of the Veterans Benefits, Health Care, and Information Technology Act of 2006 (the Act) and Executive Order 13360, providing opportunities for service-disabled veteran-owned small businesses (SDVOSB) to increase their Federal contracting and subcontracting."
