EO:13803,FRDOC:2017-26765,2017-26765,Notice,2017-12-12,82 FR 58452,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,1,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2017/12/12/2017-26765.txt,99762f8426366df8452dd1dffb6c61840386acc11417c14da078ce0b32051c44,"Pursuant to the NASA Authorization Act of 1991 (Pub. L. 101-611, Section 121), and Executive Order 13803 (``Reviving The National Space Council''), Section 6, signed by the President on June 30, 2017, NASA has established the National Space Council Users' Advisory Group (UAG)."
EO:13803,FRDOC:2017-27211,2017-27211,Notice,2017-12-18,82 FR 60054,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,2,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2017/12/18/2017-27211.txt,01c48445b0bd2e4ad31482fe9fe5cd3f5250dbfef9e6864b44908243396b5fff,"The UAG is a new Federal advisory committee under the Federal Advisory Committee Act (FACA) being established pursuant to the National Aeronautics and Space Administration Authorization Act, Fiscal Year 1991 (Pub. L. 101-611, Section 121) and Executive Order 13803, Section 6 (``Reviving the National Space Council'') signed by the President on June 30, 2017."
EO:13803,FRDOC:2019-05972,2019-05972,Proposed Rule,2019-04-15,84 FR 15296,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,1,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2019/04/15/2019-05972.txt,936e27d971fc0707ec7e854a9aeb40fb422333188a9ab8405697e3d7e45cfe8a,"On June 30, 2017, President Donald J. Trump signed Executive Order 13803, which reestablished the National Space Council to provide a coordinated process for developing and monitoring the implementation of national space policy and strategy."
