EO:14218,FRDOC:2025-13118,2025-13118,Notice,2025-07-14,90 FR 31232,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,1,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2025/07/14/2025-13118.txt,804cb3354e4cf3c515411355c08c430f666c1e031bf1fe5b9bca7adac1e89c1d,"This Administration recognizes that it is ``it is national policy that `aliens within the Nation's borders not depend on public resources to meet their needs,' and that `it is a compelling government interest to remove the incentive for illegal immigration provided by the availability of public benefits.''' Executive Order 14218, Sec. 1, 90 FR 10581 (quoting PRWORA, alterations omitted)."
