EO:9424,FRDOC:98-26160,98-26160,Rule,1998-09-30,63 FR 52158,cross_reference,mention,False,False,False,,1,False,https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/1998/09/30/98-26160.txt,563f1db4cc705fbc66950c14d8cd2908b518176cd6fc697aeebe81ee2df2dc95,(b) No fee is required for each patent application and patent against which a document required by Executive Order 9424 is to be filed if: (1) The document does not affect title and is so identified in the cover sheet (see Sec. 3.31(c)(2)); and (2) The document and cover sheet are mailed to the Office in compliance with Sec. 3.27(b).
